   226	§3.2 it is one of the c̃ ∈ c⁰; write q := F(q̃) ∈ U.  Note also that Ũ is
   227	incident to exactly one vertex of L̃∞ + g̃₂ (Corollary 3.8 a)), namely h̃, so
   228	every branch hanging off the interior of ⟨g̃₁h̃⟩ is contained in Ũ; in
   229	particular B ⊂ Ũ.
