+It then verifies the explicit parametrization and its four nodes
+(`xmodel/rep-96-inner-opus5-20260901.md:59-84,109-141`). These are target
+series/place invariants. The same report finds only six classes of
+`rho_inf`-fixed `S_4` data and says that the type passes GATE-3; it does not
+produce a representation of the full complement group
+(`xmodel/rep-96-inner-opus5-20260901.md:483-518,740-743`). The full braid
+factorization remains the first missing object
+(`xmodel/rep-96-inner-opus5-20260901.md:607-641`).
