+The escalation is therefore precise. It is **not** "recheck all five Domrina
+packages" and not "the repaired proof disagrees with a realized curve." It is:
+the campaign currently lacks the route from its target residual to the source
+state on which the repaired proof operates. Until that bridge is produced,
+there is no concrete `Q1 union Q2` fork to run.
