+**Lane:** `DOMRINA-INSTANTIATE`. **Desk-pass verdict:** outcome **(c),
+`NO-KILL / NOT-INSTANTIABLE`**. The proposed first fork is ill-typed as stated.
+Lemma 2.12 can force Domrina's distinguished **source-boundary root**
