+declared structure packages); it does not thereby eliminate the realized curve
+as a curve. No single `(F*)/(S*)` package is localized, because no Fig. 11 row or
+Lemma-2.12 vertex is selected. The sharp escalation target is instead the missing
+bridge `OPEN[RESIDUAL-TO-DOMRINA-STATE]`.
+
+## 0. Custody, scope, and status changes
