+## 6. Exact escalation target
+
+Open the following typed item:
+
+```text
+OPEN[RESIDUAL-TO-DOMRINA-STATE]
+
+Input:
+  a realized joint target pair D_1 union D_2;
+  a full local-braid-fixed representation for the branched D_1,
