+```text
+input:  a~ in <g1~ g2~> in the source tree L~;
+        Q1 = br_a~(g1~), Q2 = br_a~(g2~);
+        Q3 = the components of delta(g1~ g2~) incident to a~;
+        det L~_infinity <= 0;
+        det Q3 > 0;
+        det(a~ gi~) <= det(delta(a~ gi~))^2 det Q3 for i=1 or 2.
+
+output: v~ in Q1 union Q2.
+```
