+| carrier/owner budget | one nontrivial carrier `(mu,s,K)=(2,1,0)`, one trivial carrier `(1,1,0)` on a second owner, owner weights `(2,1)` (displayed unordered as `W=(1,2)`) | a budget/ownership profile, not a dual graph |
